<title>USA: Rohm and Haas raises quarterly dividend.</title>
<headline>Rohm and Haas raises quarterly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rohm and Haas Co on Tuesday voted to increase the quarterly dividend paid on its common stock to $0.50 from $0.45 per share.</p>
<p>This is an 11 percent increase. The common dividend will be payable on September 1, 1997, to shareholders of record on August 8, 1997.</p>
<p>Nineteen ninety-seven is the twentieth consecutive year in which the company has increased total dividends on its common shares.</p>
